        'story.card1.h3': 'The discovery',
        'story.card1.p': 'A high school student in Izmir spends months with a basic calculator, hunting for an algorithm to detect prime numbers. The divisibility rules of numbers sharing the same last digit look alike — and that observation becomes one equation covering them all, mailed to TUBITAK as a math project. Nothing happens.',
