        'formula.priorArt': '<b>Prior art.</b> This is a <i>trimming test</i>, and the family it belongs to was published by <a href="#prior-art">A. Zbikowski in 1861</a>. It is also exactly one member of the two-parameter family of <a href="#prior-art">Grinberg &amp; Luryi (2014)</a> — the member with the parameter hard-wired, which is what breaks the six rules below.',
        'formula.note': 'Apply <code>f</code> to the dividend, then to the result, and keep going until the number is small. The 36 rules it produces for the divisors between 11 and 50 include familiar classics:',
